    "source": "https://peaksaunas.com/policies/shipping-policy",
    "approved_by": "site",
    "date": "2026-09-09"
  },
  {
    "id": "returns-policy",
    "text": "Peak Saunas returns require the sauna to be disassembled and repacked in its original crate; all returns are subject to a 25% restocking fee and the customer pays return shipping. Orders cancelled before shipping incur a 5% cancellation fee.",
